WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.009 --> 00:00:02.770
- I remember the first time I saw her.

00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:04.870
I felt like I'd known her my whole life.

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:06.689
I kinda fell in love with her.

00:00:06.689 --> 00:00:08.549
Couldn't wait to see her again and again.

00:00:09.539 --> 00:00:11.970
They took her away.

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:13.370
- She showed me what a loving relationship

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:15.230
actually looked like.

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:18.309
I miss her every day.

00:00:19.149 --> 00:00:21.479
Not even magic can bring her back.

00:00:21.479 --> 00:00:23.859
- When she found happiness,
it gave me hope, you know?

00:00:26.269 --> 00:00:28.550
And then it all ended.

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:33.550
(somber violin and piano music)

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:36.609
(swishing)

00:00:36.609 --> 00:00:37.769
(squeaking)

00:00:39.099 --> 00:00:40.110
- I am affected.

00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:41.210
- I am affected.

00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:43.189
- I am affected.

00:00:43.189 --> 00:00:47.430
- Since 1976, 65% of all queer
female television characters

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:48.870
have died.

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:53.590
(somber violin and piano)

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:57.030
- According to
autostraddle.com, in 2015 alone,

00:00:57.030 --> 00:01:00.770
24 queer female characters
have been killed on television.

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.910
- Already in 2016, there
have been 12 deaths.

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:07.269
How many more?

00:01:07.269 --> 00:01:08.390
- How many more?

00:01:08.390 --> 00:01:09.470
- How many more?

00:01:09.470 --> 00:01:10.689
- How many more?

00:01:10.689 --> 00:01:12.209
All of them? OK.

00:01:12.209 --> 00:01:13.310
- We deserve better.

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:14.949
- So we wanted to give
the writers out there

00:01:14.949 --> 00:01:17.950
some more options for their
queer female characters.

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:19.970
- Like, just not killing them, maybe.

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:21.790
- Or you could have that
stray bullet miss them

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:23.289
and hit someone else for a change.

00:01:23.289 --> 00:01:25.069
- Give them an identical twin.

00:01:25.069 --> 00:01:26.670
- Have them get their master's degree.

00:01:27.510 --> 00:01:29.510
That can take them out of a season or two.

00:01:29.510 --> 00:01:32.070
- They pull a groin muscle
just from wonderful sex.

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:33.930
- Why not a gay ghost?

00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:35.589
- I would love to be haunted by a lesbian.

00:01:35.589 --> 00:01:37.509
- Let their spirit live inside a cat.

00:01:37.509 --> 00:01:39.090
- Have them go to a carnival.

00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:40.770
- They can grow old, and
have a family, and a dog

00:01:40.770 --> 00:01:42.789
and sit on a porch and drink iced tea.

00:01:44.729 --> 00:01:46.330
I think that would make for great TV!

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:47.229
- Please.

00:01:47.229 --> 00:01:47.930
- Please.

00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:48.870
- Please.

00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:51.280
- [All] Stop killing
queer female characters.

00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:57.549
- (whispers) I can't do this.

00:02:00.669 --> 00:02:02.530
- She's not the same, OK?

00:02:02.530 --> 00:02:03.420
(squeaking)

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:04.310
Her marriage is dead.

